{
  "page": {
    "margins_mm": {
      "top": 20,
      "bottom": 20,
      "left": 20,
      "right": 20
    }
  },
  "styles": [
    {
      "name": "ContractTitle",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size_pt": 24,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "name": "SectionHeading",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size_pt": 14,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "name": "BodyText",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size_pt": 11
    },
    {
      "name": "WarningText",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size_pt": 12,
      "bold": true,
      "color": "CC0000"
    },
    {
      "name": "FormLabel",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size_pt": 11,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "name": "FormValue",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size_pt": 11
    },
    {
      "name": "SmallText",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size_pt": 9
    }
  ],
  "header": "VEHICLE TRIP CHECKLIST / INSPECTION FORM",
  "footer_page_numbers": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VEHICLE TRIP CHECKLIST",
      "level": 1,
      "style": "ContractTitle"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This checklist documents the condition of the Vehicle at the start and end of the rental period. Both Owner and Renter must complete and sign. Complete pre-trip section within 24 hours of pickup. Complete post-trip section immediately upon return.",
      "style": "BodyText"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VEHICLE INFORMATION",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Field",
        "Value"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Make",
          "{{vehicle_make}}"
        ],
        [
          "Model",
          "{{vehicle_model}}"
        ],
        [
          "Year",
          "{{vehicle_year}}"
        ],
        [
          "VIN",
          "{{vehicle_vin}}"
        ],
        [
          "License Plate",
          "{{license_plate}}"
        ],
        [
          "Color",
          "{{vehicle_color}}"
        ],
        [
          "Trip Start Date/Time",
          "{{trip_start_date}} at {{trip_start_time}}"
        ],
        [
          "Trip End Date/Time",
          "{{trip_end_date}} at {{trip_end_time}}"
        ],
        [
          "Owner Name",
          "{{owner_name}}"
        ],
        [
          "Renter Name",
          "{{renter_name}}"
        ],
        [
          "Renter License #",
          "{{renter_license_number}}"
        ],
        [
          "Pickup Location",
          "{{pickup_location}}"
        ],
        [
          "Return Location",
          "{{return_location}}"
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "AT THE BEGINNING OF THE RESERVATION",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Complete the following before the Renter drives the Vehicle away:",
      "style": "BodyText"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "Check the Renter's driver's license \u2014 verify it is valid and matches the name on the reservation.",
        "Walk around the Vehicle. Note mileage, fuel level, and any pre-existing damage below.",
        "NOTE: The Renter may be held responsible for any damage NOT indicated on this form, documented in trip photos, or emailed to support.",
        "Take photos of the Vehicle from all angles. Upload to the Platform within 24 hours of trip start."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "PRE-EXISTING DAMAGE / CONCERNS (check all that apply)",
      "level": 3,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "Scratches or chips on paint",
        "Dents or dings",
        "Windshield cracks (longer than 2 inches = NOT ELIGIBLE for coverage)",
        "Interior stains, tears, odors, or missing items",
        "Mechanical issues (brakes, steering, suspension, engine noise)",
        "Missing or damaged accessories (floor mats, cargo cover, spare tire, jack)",
        "Malfunctioning lights, signals, wipers, or electronics",
        "None \u2014 Vehicle appears in good condition"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "DETAILED DAMAGE NOTES (describe location and size of each item checked above)",
      "level": 3,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use descriptions like: \"3-inch scratch on driver-side rear door\", \"small ding on front bumper passenger side\"",
      "style": "BodyText"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Item #",
        "Location (be specific)",
        "Type (scratch/dent/crack/stain/etc.)",
        "Size (inches/cm)",
        "Photo Taken? (Y/N)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "1",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "2",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "3",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "4",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "5",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "6",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "7",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "8",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MILEAGE AND FUEL",
      "level": 3,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Measurement",
        "Before Trip",
        "After Trip"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Odometer Reading",
          "{{odometer_start}} miles",
          "{{odometer_end}} miles"
        ],
        [
          "Total Miles Driven",
          "",
          "{{total_miles_driven}} miles"
        ],
        [
          "Fuel Level",
          "{{fuel_level_start}}",
          "{{fuel_level_end}}"
        ],
        [
          "Fuel Gauge Drawing",
          "[Draw line showing fuel gauge position]",
          "[Draw line showing fuel gauge position]"
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "TRIP ACKNOWLEDGMENT",
      "level": 3,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "By signing below, both parties acknowledge the Vehicle condition as documented above.",
      "style": "BodyText"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Party",
        "Signature",
        "Date",
        "Time"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Owner",
          "_____________________________",
          "{{owner_sign_date}}",
          "{{owner_sign_time}}"
        ],
        [
          "Renter",
          "_____________________________",
          "{{renter_sign_date}}",
          "{{renter_sign_time}}"
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "AT THE END OF THE RESERVATION",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "Review fuel level and mileage against the pre-trip values above.",
        "Conduct a walk-around inspection. Compare to the pre-existing damage notes above.",
        "Check for any new damage, issues, or concerns.",
        "If no new issues found: Check 'No issues' box below.",
        "If new issues found: Check 'Found issue' box, describe below, take photos, and report within 24 hours."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "END-OF-TRIP FINDINGS",
      "level": 3,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "\u2610 NO ISSUES \u2014 Vehicle returned in same condition as documented above. No new damage or concerns.",
        "\u2610 FOUND ISSUE \u2014 New damage or concern identified. See details below."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "NEW DAMAGE / ISSUES (if any \u2014 required if 'Found issue' checked above)",
      "level": 3,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Item #",
        "Location",
        "Type",
        "Size",
        "Photo Taken?",
        "When Discovered"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "1",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "2",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "3",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Damage must be reported within 24 hours of trip end to be eligible for coverage. Report via the Platform or email to {{support_email}}.",
      "style": "BodyText"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "FEEDBACK",
      "level": 3,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Leave each other feedback to help us all maintain a safe and respectful marketplace.",
      "style": "BodyText"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Party",
        "Feedback / Comments",
        "Rating (1-5)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Owner feedback for Renter",
          "",
          "{{owner_rating}}"
        ],
        [
          "Renter feedback for Owner",
          "",
          "{{renter_rating}}"
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "SIGNATURES \u2014 END OF TRIP",
      "level": 3,
      "style": "SectionHeading"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Party",
        "Signature",
        "Date",
        "Time"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Owner",
          "_____________________________",
          "{{owner_end_date}}",
          "{{owner_end_time}}"
        ],
        [
          "Renter",
          "_____________________________",
          "{{renter_end_date}}",
          "{{renter_end_time}}"
        ]
      ],
      "style": "Table Grid"
    }
  ]
}